  "query_preview": "(Friday through Monday)...\nCooling of high temperatures will begin to spread inland on\nThursday and Friday with greater drying of the mid and high level\nmoisture for next weekend. For next Sunday, high temperatures will\ncool to a few degrees below average to around 5 degrees below\naverage for portions of the inland valleys. High temperatures for\nnext Sunday will range from the 70s near the coast to the mid 80s\nto lower 90s for the Inland Empire with 100 to 104 for the lower\ndeserts. For next Sunday and Monday, low temperatures for the\ninland valleys will be mostly in the 50s and for the coast into\nthe western valleys mostly in the 60s.",
